  "description": "As close to a pro level bike as you can get without breaking the bank, the Plaza features a stacked list of quality parts that compromise nothing. Starting with full chromoly frame, fork and handlebar as our material of choice, this bike is built to last and blast! Bolted to those tasty bits is our Haro Sata double walled rims laced to sealed bearing hubs with a freecoaster out back and wrapped in some sticky 2.4\" la Mesa tires. The 9\" bars attach to a top-load stem and spin with ease with the help of the Haro sealed bearing integrated headset.\nFull Cr-Mo Frame w/ 1-1/8\" Integrated Headtube, MID BB Shell, Removable 990 Brake Mounts & 14mm Axle Drop-outs\nHaro Cr-Mo Bar, 9\" Rise with Lineage CNC Top-Load, 52mm Ext.\nFull Cr-Mo 1 1/8\" Threadless w/ One Piece CNC Internally Threaded Steerer Tube & Tapered Legs\n3-pc Cr-Mo 8 Spline 170mm - 25t Alloy Team Disc Chainring\nHaro 78' PC w/ Cr-Mo Axle, 9/16\"\n20\" Haro Sata Alloy 36h, Double Wall Alloy Sealed Front w/ Alloy 9t Sealed Freecoaster Rear\nHaro 78' Alloy 990 U-Brake with Haro 78' Two Finger",
